# ============================================================================
# Educonnect / EduVerse — Root .prettierignore
# Shared across the monorepo. Prettier never touches build/vendor files.
# ============================================================================

# Frontend (Next.js) build & vendor
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/web-build/
**/.cache/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Backend (Python / uv) build & vendor
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/

# Coverage & test output
**/coverage/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# Generated/exports & uploads
**/exports/
**/generated/
**/uploads/
**/*.pdf
**/*.xlsx
**/*.csv

# OS / editor cruft
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log